OL,3,GNEWSAParamedic sustains multiple
OL,4,Ainjuries in hospital assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FA female paramedic has been seriously
OL,7,Fassaulted at Altnagelvin Hospital in
OL,8,FLondonderry while responding to someone
OL,9,Fin need of medical assistance.
OL,11,FPolice said the attack happened at
OL,12,Fabout 17:45 GMT on Saturday and a
OL,13,Fsuspect has been identified.
OL,15,FThe Northern Ireland Ambulance Service
OL,16,F(NIAS) said the paramedic sustained
OL,17,Finjuries to the back of her head, neck,
OL,18,Fface and hands during the attack. They
OL,19,Fsaid she is also believed "to have
OL,20,Fsuffered concussion".
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
