OL,3,GNEWSAParamedic sustains multiple
OL,4,Ainjuries in hospital assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey added that the incident happened
OL,7,Fafter the NIAS received a call to
OL,8,Fprovide medical assistance to a male
OL,9,Fpatient who was being transported by
OL,10,Fambulance to the hospital, following
OL,11,Finitial treatment.
